@model Portal.Pages.RuntimeChart
@* The trend recorder along the foot of the card: the one number that belongs to the path rather
   than to any single stage.

   Measured on the scale set, labelled for the path. "Throughput leaving the prefix" is what an
   operator wants to read; `Network Out Total` on the VMSS is what Azure measures. They are the same
   bytes, which is why the copy stands (design.md, Open). *@
<div class="sx-flow">
    <div class="sx-flow-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Throughput leaving the prefix</span>
        <span class="sx-flow-n @Model.ToneClass">@Model.Value<small> @Model.Suffix</small></span>
        <span class="sx-flow-d">@Model.Detail · 1-minute samples, last hour</span>
    </div>
    <partial name="_RuntimeGraph" model="Model.Chart" />
</div>
